{
  "id": "behavior-record",
  "term": "behavior record",
  "definition": "A behavior record is a collection of data gathered while a person is actively behaving, often combining multiple time-based measures such as brain activity, eye movements, motion, or respiration. It may also include time-stamped events and contextual information so behavior can be examined across situations and over time.",
